y consumable Wave 1 rows: 75\n- Accepted fact question count: 24\n- Provisional context question count: 75\n- Scheduled remaining rows: 3,455\n- Explicitly blocked rows: 0\n- Production shards: 87\n- Go shards: 52\n- Review-deferred shards: 17\n- Visual-evidence-deferred shards: 18\n\n## Boundaries\n\nNo production RAG reindex, vector-store mutation, remote Supabase mutation, frontend/runtime integration, or external LLM/VLM/model/API call was performed. Accepted/provisional Wave 1 consumption remains non-blocking while the remaining full-scope scheduler continues.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node --experimental-vm-modules ./node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-full-codex-shard-scheduler.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-wave1-promotion.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-v1-promotion-thresholds.test.js` -> 3 suites / 13 tests passed\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-full-codex-shard-scheduler.mjs --write` -> validator_status `pass`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true ./node_modules/.bin/eslint scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-full-codex-shard-scheduler.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-full-codex-shard-scheduler.test.js` -> passed\n- `git diff --check -- . ':!node_modules'` -> passed\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> warning-only: branch naming / ahead-of-origin; worktree clean; report artifact guard healthy; A+ ratchet healthy\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T15:18:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T15:30:17Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T15:30:16Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T15:30:16Z","merge_commit_sha":"b70e2eaf4d4e896ac032ad6b16a2107693924950","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1399/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1399/comments","review_comment_url":"h